1、作为风控团队的主要联系人，快速、准确地帮助销售团队和广告主排查并解决与风控相关的问题；
2、识别广告审核系统的优化机会，并与跨职能团队合作推动改进，从而系统性地提升广告主体验；
3、通过教育性举措，帮助广告主理解并降低其风险状况，提升其在平台上的广告投放顺畅度；
4、深入理解不同行业及广告主的商业模式，作为商业解决方案专家，为战略级广告主及销售团队提供定制化的支持策略。

1.Serve as the primary liaison of the risk control team to efficiently and accurately assist sales teams and advertisers in troubleshooting and resolving risk-control-related issues;
2.Identify optimization potentials for the ad review system and collaborate with cross-functional teams to implement upgrades for systematic improvement of advertiser experience;
3.Launch educational initiatives to help advertisers understand relevant rules and mitigate operational risks, enabling smoother ad campaign delivery on the platform;
4.Develop in-depth insights into business models across diverse industries and advertiser portfolios; Act as a commercial solution specialist to deliver customized support strategies for key strategic advertisers and sales teams.

1.Manage and oversee specific fresh category (fruits, vegetables, meat, seafood, dairy),developing category strategies and procurement plans;
2.Analyze market trends, consumer demand, and competition to optimize product assortment and improve sales and profitability;
3.Handle supply chain management, establish strong relationships with suppliers, conduct procurement negotiations, control costs, and optimize supply channels;
4.Monitor inventory and product turnover, develop promotional strategies to enhance inventory turnover and reduce waste;
5.Collaborate with various departments (e.g., procurement, logistics, marketing) to ensure smooth product supply, quality, and market promotion;
6.Stay updated on industry trends, policies, and regulations to ensure business compliance and continuously optimize procurement and operational processes;
7.Lead and train the team to enhance professional capabilities and work efficiency. 1.Bachelor’s degree or above, preferably in marketing, supply chain management, food science, or related fields.
At least 5 years of experience in category management or procurement in the fresh food industry, preferably in retail,  quick commerce (Q-commerce),e-commerce, or supermarkets/hypermarkets
2.Strong understanding of market trends, supply chain systems, and category management methods in the fresh food industry.
3.Excellent negotiation, data analysis, and market insight skills.
4.Strong communication, coordination, and team management experience.
5.High sense of responsibility, strong ability to work under pressure, and keen business acumen with an innovative mindset.

1.负责线上店的商品管理,对于商品的效期管理、品质管理、损耗管理负责,负责门店的水产养殖和销售的整体管理;
2.负责线上店的进销存管理,负责线上店内门店的收货、上架、库存、库位的管理工作,优化库内的动线和库位,对于商品的周转和资产、设备的安全准确负责;
3.负责线上店订单的履约,保证在更快的时间保质保量履约客户的订单,不断追求降本提效,致力于为客户提供更好的服务,不断精益求精;配合总部各项营销策略的实施,负责线上各品类商品的日常的促销活动实施;
4.负责线上店现场的人员管理,包括招聘、培训和效率管理,负责数据管理和异常事件处理,维护周边社区关系;进行日常经营管理工作,包含对各项运营指标进行监控和分析,确保销售达成；
5.新开门店开业前期筹备相关工作。 1.大专及以上学历，3-5年连锁门店经营管理经验/仓储运营管理经验；
2.对生鲜商品有一定的认知，熟悉门店促销管理、损耗控制管理、品类管理等，了解仓储的进销存管理，了解互联网的生产管理；
3.良好的沟通能力及跨部门团队合作精神，学习能力佳，责任心强，愿意接受挑战，以结果为导向；
4.善于劳务人员的管理工作，熟悉与零售相关的法律法规；
5.熟练操作办公软件。
